extends ../../layouts/master.pug

block title
  title Salvation Army Degree Partnership | AdVantage Program at NBC
  meta(name='description', content='Salvation Army officers can complete a Bachelor of Arts in Ministry through Nazarene Bible College’s AdVantage Accelerated Degree Program.')
block header
  include ../../components/header.pug

block content
  section.section-box
    .banner-hero.bg-service-2
      .container
        .row
          .col-lg-12.text-center
            h1.text-display-2 Benefits for Salvation Army Officers

  section.section-box
    .container
      .row
        .col-lg-2.col-sm-1.col-12
        .col-lg-8.col-sm-10.col-12
            p.text-body-lead-large.color-gray-600.mt-20
              | Are you currently serving with The Salvation Army? Have you been considering earning or completing your bachelor’s degree?
            p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-20
              | Nazarene Bible College has a cooperative relationship with all four Salvation Army USA territories to provide additional education opportunities for you.
            p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-20
              | NBC’s AdVantage Accelerated Degree Completion Program is designed to meet your needs. This program offers the Bachelor of Arts in Ministry (B.A.Min.) degree with your choice of major from four options: Leadership and Ethics, Bible and Theology, Counseling for Christian Ministries, and Hispanic Pastoral Ministries.
            p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-20
              | Questions about your choice of major or about entering this degree program? Contact the Admissions Office at admissions@nbc.edu or 800-873-3873, ext. 5060.
            p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-20
              | Apply for NBC’s AdVantage Accelerated Degree Completion Program by clicking on one of the following links based on your current Territory assignment.

  section.section-box.pt-140.pb-50
    .container
      .row
        .col-lg-5.mb-40
          h3.text-heading-1 Apply
          p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-30
            | To apply through our AdVantage Accelerated Degree Completion Program, please click on one of the the following links based on your current Territory.
        .col-lg-7
          #accordionFAQ.accordion
            .accordion-item
              h2#headingOne.accordion-header
                button.accordion-button.text-heading-5(type='button', data-bs-toggle='collapse', data-bs-target='#collapseOne', aria-expanded='true', aria-controls='collapseOne')
                  | USA Southern Territory
              #collapseOne.accordion-collapse.collapse.show(aria-labelledby='headingOne', data-bs-parent='#accordionFAQ')
                .accordion-body
                  | The USA Southern Territory Officer's Education application form will need to be completed and processed through your Command Headquarters. These forms may be obtained from:
                  blockquote.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-10
                    b.font-bold Evangeline Booth College
                    br
                    | Continuing Education Center
                    br
                    | 1032 Metropolitan Parkway SW
                    br
                    | Atlanta, GA 30310
                  p Complete our Salvation-Army-specific NBC 
                    a(href='https://nbc.edu/application/login/?prog=3') admission application.
            .accordion-item
              h2#headingTwo.accordion-header
                button.accordion-button.text-heading-5.collapsed(type='button', data-bs-toggle='collapse', data-bs-target='#collapseTwo', aria-expanded='false', aria-controls='collapseTwo')
                  | USA Western Territory
              #collapseTwo.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby='headingTwo', data-bs-parent='#accordionFAQ')
                .accordion-body
                  p
                    | Complete our Salvation-Army-specific NBC 
                    a(href='https://nbc.edu/application/login/?prog=4') admission application.
                  p
                    | Officers wanting to take classes at NBC need to complete and submit the Preliminary Higher Education Application on TSAMM. For further instruction, please contact the Continuing Education Department at 310-265-6123.
            .accordion-item
              h2#headingThree.accordion-header
                button.accordion-button.text-heading-5.collapsed.text-heading-5(class='type=', data-bs-toggle='collapse', data-bs-target='#collapseThree', aria-expanded='false', aria-controls='collapseThree')
                  | USA Central Territory
              #collapseThree.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby='headingThree', data-bs-parent='#accordionFAQ')
                .accordion-body
                  p
                    | The USA Central Territory Officer's Education application form will need to be completed and processed through your Command Headquarters. These forms may be obtained from:
                  blockquote.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-10
                    b.font-bold Officer Resource and Development Secretary or the Resource Coordinator in ORD
                    br
                    | 5550 Prairie Stone Parkway
                    br
                    | Hoffman Estates, IL 60192
                    br
                    | (847) 294-2061
                  p
                    | Complete our Salvation-Army-specific NBC 
                    a(href='https://nbc.edu/application/login/?prog=5') admission application.
            .accordion-item
              h2#headingFour.accordion-header
                button.accordion-button.text-heading-5.collapsed(type='button', data-bs-toggle='collapse', data-bs-target='#collapseFour', aria-expanded='false', aria-controls='collapseFour')
                  | USA Eastern Territory
              #collapseFour.accordion-collapse.collapse(aria-labelledby='headingFour', data-bs-parent='#accordionFAQ')
                .accordion-body
                  p
                    | The USA Eastern Territory Officer's Degree Proposal application will need to be completed. The application can be obtained from: 
                  blockquote
                    b.font-bold Office of the Territorial Education Sectary at THQ
                    br
                    | 440 West Nyack Road
                    br
                    | West Nyack, NY 10994
                  p or through an email to the Territorial Education Secretary. The completed application is processed with your command head and then forwarded on to THQ for the review of the Territorial Education Council.
                  p.mt-10
                    | Complete our Salvation-Army-specific NBC 
                    a(href='https://nbc.edu/application/login/?prog=6') admission application.